      {
        "parameters": {
          "content": "## 2. Scrape Google Maps\nCalls Apify's Google Maps actor (`compass/crawler-google-places`) with contact scraping on, so each place comes back with any email addresses found on its website.\n\nThe run-sync endpoint waits up to 5 minutes, which covers about 100 places. Places whose `place_id` is already in the sheet are dropped, so re-running a search only adds new businesses.",
          "height": 560,
          "width": 700,
          "color": 4
        },
        "id": "9711dd54-f119-49b6-b911-5407e0c47313",
        "name": "Sticky Note 65d7c45a",
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
        "typeVersion": 1,
        "position": [
          672,
          -64
        ]
      },
